# App icon source of truth: tools/generate_app_icon.py renders the slider-glass
# artwork into two committed, CI-pinned sets —
#   Assets.xcassets/AppIcon.appiconset  full-bleed, for actool -> Assets.car (macOS 26+)
#   Resources/AppIcon.iconset           masked,    for iconutil -> AppIcon.icns (macOS 14/15)
# The design process — candidate masters, review sheets and the v1->v4.1 decision
# log — is tracked under design/; read design/README.md before touching any icon.
# The deprecated v1.17 "leaf" drafts were purged in e5f4b2d — do not reintroduce
# them; stray icon artifacts are intentionally NOT ignored so they show up in git
# status and get cleaned instead of lurking.
